(CHAPTER 1 | MODULE 7.0: SEMESTER REGISTRATION, CREDIT LOAD, AND LABORATORY SAFETY) Tj
T*
(PROTOCOLS) Tj
T*
(========================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 3.4: STANDARD ATTENDANCE EVALUATION & DEBARMENT POLICY) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Attendance carries a mandatory 10% weightage across all courses offered at Mirai) Tj
T*
(School of Technology. Marks for the attendance component are awarded strictly) Tj
T*
(according to the following tier table:) Tj
T*
(- 90% and above: 10 marks) Tj
T*
(- 80% to 89.99%: 8 marks) Tj
T*
(- 75% to 79.99%: 6 marks) Tj
T*
(- 60% to 74.99%: 4 marks) Tj
T*
(- Below 60%: 0 marks) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(DEBARMENT POLICY & FINAL EXAM ELIGIBILITY: Every student must maintain a minimum) Tj
T*
(of 75% attendance to be eligible to sit for the End-Semester Final Examination. A) Tj
T*
(student with 72% attendance receives 4 marks in the attendance evaluation tier,) Tj
T*
(but because 72% is below the mandatory 75% eligibility threshold, the student is) Tj
T*
(strictly DEBARRED \(not eligible\) from appearing in the Final Exam for that subject) Tj
T*
(unless condoned via an approved medical exemption buffer \(up to 15%\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( Operational Compliance Note \(Ref-1-07\): All personnel and automated auditing) Tj
T*
(systems reviewing 'Mirai School of Technology Academic & Hostel Policy Handbook') Tj
T*
(must verify the numerical thresholds and procedural steps stated on Page 7 above.) Tj
T*
(Any deviation from the explicit parameters documented in this section requires) Tj
T*
(formal written escalation.) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
50 35 Td (Page 7 of 50 | Confidential Assessment Corpus - Do Not Distribute) Tj
ET
