(SECTION 7.1: 7-DAY SUBMISSION RULE FOR MEDICAL LEAVE & DUTY LEAVE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(All supporting documents for Medical Leave \(registered medical practitioner) Tj
T*
(certificate, prescription, and discharge summary\) must be submitted to the Campus) Tj
T*
(Manager within 7 days of recovery \(counted from the last day of illness or) Tj
T*
(treatment\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CONSEQUENCES OF LATE SUBMISSION: Requests submitted after the 7-day window will) Tj
T*
(NOT be accepted under any circumstances. The absence will be treated as a regular) Tj
T*
(unauthorized absence and will count against the student's attendance percentage) Tj
T*
(with zero relaxation granted, even if the illness was genuine.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( Operational Compliance Note \(Ref-1-24\): All personnel and automated auditing) Tj
T*
(systems reviewing 'Mirai School of Technology Academic & Hostel Policy Handbook') Tj
T*
(must verify the numerical thresholds and procedural steps stated on Page 24 above.) Tj
T*
(Any deviation from the explicit parameters documented in this section requires) Tj
T*
(formal written escalation.) Tj
