T*
() Tj
T*
(Students interested in establishing a new student club must first demonstrate) Tj
T*
(verifiable support from at least 40% of the total batch students. Once the 40%) Tj
T*
(batch signature threshold is met, the formal proposal and budget must be submitted) Tj
T*
(to the designated Faculty Coordinator for initial review and feasibility approval) Tj
T*
(before the Faculty Coordinator forwards it to Management. Students must never) Tj
T*
(bypass the Faculty Coordinator to approach Management directly.) Tj
